{"title": "Odd Gift", "pageid": 28538, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Odd_Gift", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Odd Gift</b> is a passive feature that prevents Jaheira from being cursed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While wearing Khalid's Gift, <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a> cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_(status_group)\" title=\"Cursed (status group)\">Cursed</a></span>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Khalid%27s_Gift\" title=\"Khalid's Gift\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Khalid%27s_Gift\" title=\"Khalid's Gift\">Khalid's Gift</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>If Jaheira is <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_(status_group)\" title=\"Cursed (status group)\">Cursed</a></span> and puts on <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Khalid%27s_Gift\" title=\"Khalid's Gift\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Khalid%27s_Gift\" title=\"Khalid's Gift\">Khalid's Gift</a>, it instantly removes them all.</li>\n<li>The Odd Gift passive is unique both in granting blanket immunity to the cursed status group and in applying only to Jaheira.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195909\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1583/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13567/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4722/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 972103/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.870      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.870      1 -total\n 28.96%   12.124      2 Template:Condition_Type\n 25.32%   10.602     16 Template:Trim\n 24.77%   10.372      2 Template:Icon_text\n 23.62%  